// little and then west along it into the inside corner with the wing, onto whose east side she turns, the stick
// held west carrying her on along it (M6 A16a's latched stick); south along that side round the outside corner
// onto the wing's south face, the stick held south carrying her on along that; and up that to the top, where
// the stick still up tops out with a mantle onto the wing's top. There she steps in from its edge and stands.
// Legs fitted by running them: the replay's checksums say where it went.
